  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner Liaison Security Operations II Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID supported the Partner Liaison Security Operations II activity in Ethiopia, implemented by The Mitchell Group, to strengthen safety and security coordination for U.S. Government implementing partners operating in complex environments. The activity improves information sharing, security communications, risk monitoring, incident tracking, and liaison with the U.S. Embassy Regional Security Office and other relevant actors. Through this support, USAID helps implementing partners better anticipate and respond to security risks, maintain program continuity, and deliver development and humanitarian assistance more safely and effectively.</narrative>
  </description>
